{{!--
    Native Ghost comments.

    {{#if comments}} is the entire gate. The helper renders nothing at all when
    comments are off for the site or closed for this post, so there is no
    settings check to duplicate here and no way for the two to disagree.

    Ghost injects the comment UI itself through {{ghost_foot}}; this only
    provides the heading and the box it lands in.
--}}
{{#if comments}}
    <section class="ghost-comments">
        <h2 class="ghost-comments__title">Comments</h2>
        {{comments}}
    </section>
{{/if}}
